    CONTROL         "High performance will provide the best game performance at the sacrifice of visual quality.  The Recommended System Specs:  PII 300 MHz, 64MB Ram,  8MB Direct 3D Compatible Video Card.",IDC_STATIC,"Static",0x20000,15,47,250,25
    CONTROL         "Average Performance",IDC_STATIC,"Button",0x7,7,102,259,62
    CONTROL         "Average performance will provide a good trade-off between game performance and visual quality.  The Recommended System Specs:  PIII 500 MHz, 128MB RAM, 32MB Direct 3D Compatible Video Card.",IDC_STATIC,"Static",0x20000,12,114,250,26
    CONTROL         "High Detail",IDC_STATIC,"Button",0x7,7,169,259,61
